Generated configure policy
--------------------------

Only configure.in changes are carried. Generated configure is excluded,
including d2ce32b7afd3d79e810c08051c937106cbdf1332 and the configure halves of
b8c95ad64da5de58857c72f4b3644d90c6e6e53c,
0315820b4cd870617aa1b96252effb983f363fcb, and
597e838fc31b3a863a353a823fdd10132681e2e9. Regenerate it with autoreconf.

Testing
-------

Run `debian/codex/tools/verify-task01-v2.sh` from the Task 1 checkout. It checks
the exact series, whitespace, generated-configure exclusion, fuzz-free quilt
application, comparison with the pinned full-client reference, autoreconf, and
four parallel GNU C23 build profiles using the system default GCC.

Unresolved work
---------------

This task does not modernize general Debian packaging, complete copyright
or policy review, establish an adopter or maintainer, or demonstrate upload
readiness. Those require later human decisions and review.
